{# Showcase EA flash-messages override.

   EA's stock template reads `app.flashes` which consumes the
   flash bag. The showcase's `crud/index.html.twig` then calls
   `polysource_toasts()` in `block main` — but the bag is
   already empty, so the v0.5.0 #4 toast helper renders nothing.

   Empty this template: defer flash rendering entirely to
   `polysource_toasts()`. Hosts that prefer EA's inline flash UI
   simply DON'T install this override; they get EA's default
   rendering and `polysource_toasts()` becomes a no-op (which
   is fine — `peek_all` semantics would create duplicates).

   Documented gap acknowledged: the helper and EA's flash UI
   are mutually exclusive. Showcase picks the toast version
   because the top-right placement demonstrates v0.5.0 #4
   visually.
#}
